Subject: [PATCH 1/4] TM3-TRAITS-DRIVE: trait voice lines, what a resident
 brings up, preview trace, census trait share

trait_voice.tlk: 216 trait= guarded alternatives (greeting, refusal of an invite and a favour, opinion
answers) plus reason clauses and idle remarks; edgy traits adults-only and kid-free. talk_trait_bring_up
picks a topic of a liked (65%) or disliked (35%) root for the idle chatter; talk_preview_trace and
talk_trace_trait_voice; census --traits and talk_census_traits; tests test_talk_tm3.c and
talk_census_traits_share.

