+# core/data/talk/grammar/en/trait_voice.tlk - the trait voice (TM3-TRAITS-DRIVE, docs/TALK.md 6q).
+# What a resident's traits do to the colour of the reply: a greeting, a no to an invitation or a favour, an
+# opinion they like and one they do not. Each line is guarded by `trait=` (talk_traits.h TT_*: the speaker's
+# effective set, so an edgy trait is already gone in a kid room or for a minor) and a heavier weight than the
+# plain lines, so a person with the trait says its line most of the time. Edgy traits (hot-headed, romantic,
+# snob, jealous, mean) also carry `adults_only&!kid_present` (lint L9). Nothing here is romance, a tease of a
+# person or a joke about grief; a refusal stays a plain no. The greeting is for people without their own voice (!cast: the
+# 17 cast greet in their own words, test_talk_voice). Rule names start with t_. Syntax: talkc_gen.py.
+
+
+# ---- hotheaded ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+@rule core.greet.t_hotheaded guard: trait=hotheaded&adults_only&!kid_present&!cast act: greet
+  "What? Oh, it's you, {you}. Keep it quick." w=14
+  "Hello! Sorry, I'm mid-grudge. Not at you, mostly." w=14
+@rule core.invite.t_hotheaded_no guard: trait=hotheaded&adults_only&!kid_present act: no
+  "No! I mean, no. I'm in no mood for people today, so ask me later." w=16
+  "Absolutely not. Ask me when I've stopped steaming." w=16
+  "No. Too many people, too little patience. Ask me tomorrow." w=16
+@rule core.ask_favor.t_hotheaded_no guard: trait=hotheaded&adults_only&!kid_present act: no
+  "No. Not today. Ask me when my blood has stopped doing this." w=16
+  "No. Ask someone else before I say something I'll regret." w=16
+@rule core.ask_opinion.t_hotheaded_pos guard: trait=hotheaded&adults_only&!kid_present&!stance=con act: opine_pos
+  "{x:cap}? Love it! Don't make me say it twice." w=10
+@rule core.ask_opinion.t_hotheaded_neg guard: trait=hotheaded&adults_only&!kid_present&!stance=pro act: opine_neg
+  "{x:cap}? Don't get me started. Too late, I started." w=10
+
+# ---- romantic ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+@rule core.greet.t_romantic guard: trait=romantic&adults_only&!kid_present&!cast act: greet
+  "Oh, hello, {you}. The light is doing something lovely today." w=14
+  "Hello, {you}! Everything feels a bit like a film today." w=14
+@rule core.invite.t_romantic_no guard: trait=romantic&adults_only&!kid_present act: no
+  "Oh, I'd love to, but not tonight. The evening has other plans." w=16
+  "Alas, no. I shall mourn it beautifully, but ask me again." w=16
+  "I'd love to, but the evening wants me alone. Ask me soon?" w=16
+@rule core.ask_favor.t_romantic_no guard: trait=romantic&adults_only&!kid_present act: no
+  "I can't, I'm afraid. It's a tragedy, and I'll write it down." w=16
+  "I can't, but I'll sigh about it dramatically instead." w=16
+@rule core.ask_opinion.t_romantic_pos guard: trait=romantic&adults_only&!kid_present&!stance=con act: opine_pos
+  "{x:cap}! It makes my heart do a little skip." w=10
+@rule core.ask_opinion.t_romantic_neg guard: trait=romantic&adults_only&!kid_present&!stance=pro act: opine_neg
+  "{x:cap}? Oh no. There's no poetry in it at all." w=10
+
+# ---- goofball ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+@rule core.greet.t_goofball guard: trait=goofball&!cast act: greet
+  "Hey, {you}! I practised a cool greeting. This is not it." w=14
+  "Hello! Quick, say something funny so I can steal it." w=14
+@rule core.invite.t_goofball_no guard: trait=goofball act: no
+  "Can't! I've got a very important nap-shaped hole in my day." w=16
+  "No can do. My calendar is full of nonsense, but ask me again!" w=16
+  "Can't! I'm busy teaching my socks to dance. Maybe next week?" w=16
+@rule core.ask_favor.t_goofball_no guard: trait=goofball act: no
+  "Nope! My to-do list is just a drawing of a duck, but ask tomorrow." w=16
+  "I can't! I'm too busy, but I can do a silly dance instead." w=16
+@rule core.ask_opinion.t_goofball_pos guard: trait=goofball&!stance=con act: opine_pos
+  "{x:cap}? Love it! Ten out of ten ducks." w=10
+@rule core.ask_opinion.t_goofball_neg guard: trait=goofball&!stance=pro act: opine_neg
+  "{x:cap}? Oh no. Zero ducks, would not duck again." w=10
+
+# ---- snob ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+@rule core.greet.t_snob guard: trait=snob&adults_only&!kid_present&!cast act: greet
+  "Oh, hello, {you}. Do come in. Mind the good rug." w=14
+  "Good day, {you}. I'd offer tea, but mine is rather particular." w=14
+@rule core.invite.t_snob_no guard: trait=snob&adults_only&!kid_present act: no
+  "I'll pass. I do have standards, but thank you for asking." w=16
+  "No, thank you. It's a touch beneath my calendar, but do ask again." w=16
+  "I'd rather not, but do ask again when it's somewhere nicer." w=16
+@rule core.ask_favor.t_snob_no guard: trait=snob&adults_only&!kid_present act: no
+  "I don't think so. I prefer my favours curated. Try someone less picky?" w=16
+  "I really couldn't. It's a bit below my usual favours, but thank you." w=16
+@rule core.ask_opinion.t_snob_pos guard: trait=snob&adults_only&!kid_present&!stance=con act: opine_pos
+  "{x:cap}? Yes. Rare good taste, and I'm glad you asked." w=10
+@rule core.ask_opinion.t_snob_neg guard: trait=snob&adults_only&!kid_present&!stance=pro act: opine_neg
+  "{x:cap}? Hardly my taste. I have a refined palate for things." w=10
+
+# ---- neat ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+@rule core.greet.t_neat guard: trait=neat&!cast act: greet
+  "Hello, {you}! Please wipe your feet. I'm joking, mostly." w=14
+  "Hi, {you}. Come in. Everything's in its place, including you now." w=14
+@rule core.invite.t_neat_no guard: trait=neat act: no
+  "I can't, I've got to alphabetise the spice rack." w=16
+  "No, sorry. It would throw my whole schedule into chaos, but thank you." w=16
+  "Sorry, no. The house isn't ready for me to leave it. Ask me later?" w=16
+@rule core.ask_favor.t_neat_no guard: trait=neat act: no
+  "Sorry, no. It'd mess up my list. Ask me next week, when it's tidy?" w=16
+  "No, sorry. I only have a gap on Thursday. Ask me then?" w=16
+@rule core.ask_opinion.t_neat_pos guard: trait=neat&!stance=con act: opine_pos
+  "{x:cap}? Yes, tidy and tasteful and labelled. Love it." w=10
+@rule core.ask_opinion.t_neat_neg guard: trait=neat&!stance=pro act: opine_neg
+  "{x:cap}? Messy. It doesn't fit on any of my shelves." w=10
+
+# ---- slob ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+@rule core.greet.t_slob guard: trait=slob&!cast act: greet
+  "Hey, {you}. Excuse the mess. It's a lifestyle." w=14
+  "Oh, hi! Step over the pile. It's load-bearing." w=14
+@rule core.invite.t_slob_no guard: trait=slob act: no
+  "Nah, I'm already comfy. Moving would ruin it. Maybe tomorrow." w=16
+  "I'd have to get up. So, no. Lovely offer, though." w=16
+  "Can't. I'm in the middle of a very important lie-down. Maybe later." w=16
+@rule core.ask_favor.t_slob_no guard: trait=slob act: no
+  "Eh, can't. The sofa and I have an understanding." w=16
+  "I would, but it needs trousers. Maybe later." w=16
+@rule core.ask_opinion.t_slob_pos guard: trait=slob&!stance=con act: opine_pos
+  "{x:cap}? Great. Easy, comfy, no effort, perfect." w=10
+@rule core.ask_opinion.t_slob_neg guard: trait=slob&!stance=pro act: opine_neg
+  "{x:cap}? Too much fuss. Where's the snack in that?" w=10
+
+# ---- bookworm ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+@rule core.greet.t_bookworm guard: trait=bookworm&!cast act: greet
+  "Oh, hello, {you}. Sorry, I was at the good bit of chapter nine." w=14
+  "Hi, {you}. Give me a second, I'm marking my page." w=14
+@rule core.invite.t_bookworm_no guard: trait=bookworm act: no
+  "I'd love to, but I've promised this book an evening." w=16
+  "Not tonight. Chapter twelve is calling." w=16
+  "Sorry, I'm only half through a chapter. Ask me after the ending." w=16
+@rule core.ask_favor.t_bookworm_no guard: trait=bookworm act: no
+  "I can't, I'm sorry. I'm in the middle of a very long footnote." w=16
+  "I can't, but I can recommend a book on it instead." w=16
+@rule core.ask_opinion.t_bookworm_pos guard: trait=bookworm&!stance=con act: opine_pos
+  "{x:cap}? Fascinating. There's a whole shelf on that." w=10
+@rule core.ask_opinion.t_bookworm_neg guard: trait=bookworm&!stance=pro act: opine_neg
+  "{x:cap}? I've read about it twice. Still not convinced." w=10
+
+# ---- cheerful ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+@rule core.greet.t_cheerful guard: trait=cheerful&!cast act: greet
+  "Hello, {you}! What a day! Every day, really!" w=14
+  "Hi, {you}! You made my day, and it was already great!" w=14
+@rule core.invite.t_cheerful_no guard: trait=cheerful act: no
+  "Aw, I'd love to, but I can't! Rain check? I love a rain check!" w=16
+  "Oh, sorry, not this time! Ask me again soon, I'll be smiling!" w=16
+  "Aw, not today, but it sounds fun! Ask me next time!" w=16
+@rule core.ask_favor.t_cheerful_no guard: trait=cheerful act: no
+  "I'm so sorry, I can't! But I'm cheering for you!" w=16
+  "Not this time, but I'll cheer from the side!" w=16
+@rule core.ask_opinion.t_cheerful_pos guard: trait=cheerful&!stance=con act: opine_pos
+  "{x:cap}? Love it! It makes me so happy!" w=10
+@rule core.ask_opinion.t_cheerful_neg guard: trait=cheerful&!stance=pro act: opine_neg
+  "{x:cap}? Hm, not for me! But good luck to it!" w=10
+
+# ---- gloomy ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+@rule core.greet.t_gloomy guard: trait=gloomy&!cast act: greet
+  "Oh. Hello, {you}. Nice of you to come, though it won't last." w=14
+  "Hi, {you}. Lovely weather for being slightly damp inside." w=14
+@rule core.invite.t_gloomy_no guard: trait=gloomy act: no
+  "I can't. It would only go wrong. Everything does." w=16
+  "No. I'd only bring the mood down. Ask someone cheerful instead." w=16
+  "I'd rather not, but I appreciate it. It's rare." w=16
+@rule core.ask_favor.t_gloomy_no guard: trait=gloomy act: no
+  "I'd fail, and then we'd both be sad. Ask someone luckier." w=16
+  "I can't, but I'll feel bad about it. That counts, right?" w=16
+@rule core.ask_opinion.t_gloomy_pos guard: trait=gloomy&!stance=con act: opine_pos
+  "{x:cap}? It's fine, I suppose. That's high praise from me." w=10
+@rule core.ask_opinion.t_gloomy_neg guard: trait=gloomy&!stance=pro act: opine_neg
+  "{x:cap}? Doomed from the start. Like most things." w=10
+
+# ---- jealous ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+@rule core.greet.t_jealous guard: trait=jealous&adults_only&!kid_present&!cast act: greet
+  "Oh, it's you, {you}. Who've you been talking to? No reason." w=14
+  "Hello, {you}. I was just thinking of you. And who you're with." w=14
+@rule core.invite.t_jealous_no guard: trait=jealous&adults_only&!kid_present act: no
+  "No. I'd spend it watching who else is going. Try me later." w=16
+  "I can't, and I know exactly who is going. Pass." w=16
+  "No. I'd be too busy wondering who else is going. Ask me later." w=16
+@rule core.ask_favor.t_jealous_no guard: trait=jealous&adults_only&!kid_present act: no
+  "No. Ask someone else. You probably did." w=16
+  "No. I'd rather not, but ask someone else if you must." w=16
+@rule core.ask_opinion.t_jealous_pos guard: trait=jealous&adults_only&!kid_present&!stance=con act: opine_pos
+  "{x:cap}? I love it. Don't tell anyone, they'll want it too." w=10
+@rule core.ask_opinion.t_jealous_neg guard: trait=jealous&adults_only&!kid_present&!stance=pro act: opine_neg
+  "{x:cap}? Everyone else gets it. I just don't, hmph." w=10
+
+# ---- loyal ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+@rule core.greet.t_loyal guard: trait=loyal&!cast act: greet
+  "Hello, {you}! I'll always keep a chair for you." w=14
+  "Hi, {you}. Good to see you. You know I've got your back." w=14
+@rule core.invite.t_loyal_no guard: trait=loyal act: no
+  "I can't, I gave my word to someone already. Loyal to a fault." w=16
+  "Sorry, I'm keeping a promise elsewhere. Ask me again, I swear." w=16
+  "I can't, I promised a friend first. But ask me again." w=16
+@rule core.ask_favor.t_loyal_no guard: trait=loyal act: no
+  "I can't, I've pledged my time already. Sorry, friend." w=16
+  "I can't, but I'll find you someone who can. Promise." w=16
+@rule core.ask_opinion.t_loyal_pos guard: trait=loyal&!stance=con act: opine_pos
+  "{x:cap}? Yes. And I'll back anyone who says so." w=10
+@rule core.ask_opinion.t_loyal_neg guard: trait=loyal&!stance=pro act: opine_neg
+  "{x:cap}? No. And I'd say so in front of anyone." w=10
+
+# ---- mean ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+@rule core.greet.t_mean guard: trait=mean&adults_only&!kid_present&!cast act: greet
+  "Oh. You. Hello, I guess, and try not to be boring." w=14
+  "Hello, {you}. Don't just stand there looking at things." w=14
+@rule core.invite.t_mean_no guard: trait=mean&adults_only&!kid_present act: no
+  "No. Not a chance. Go bother someone with patience, maybe." w=16
+  "Nope. I'd rather count the cracks in the ceiling." w=16
+  "No. Ask someone with more free time. Not me." w=16
+@rule core.ask_favor.t_mean_no guard: trait=mean&adults_only&!kid_present act: no
+  "No. Do it yourself. It builds character, or ask someone else." w=16
+  "No. Ask someone else, and don't make a face." w=16
+@rule core.ask_opinion.t_mean_pos guard: trait=mean&adults_only&!kid_present&!stance=con act: opine_pos
+  "{x:cap}? Fine. It's tolerable, and that's all you get." w=10
+@rule core.ask_opinion.t_mean_neg guard: trait=mean&adults_only&!kid_present&!stance=pro act: opine_neg
+  "{x:cap}? Awful. I'd say more, but you'd want to sit down." w=10
+
+# ---- kind ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+@rule core.greet.t_kind guard: trait=kind&!cast act: greet
+  "Hello, {you}! It's so lovely to see you. Are you all right?" w=14
+  "Hi, {you}. Come in, sit down, I'll put the kettle on." w=14
+@rule core.invite.t_kind_no guard: trait=kind act: no
+  "Oh, I'm so sorry, I can't. I do hope you'll ask me again." w=16
+  "I'd love to, truly, but I just can't. Please don't feel bad." w=16
+  "Sorry, I can't this time, but thank you so much for asking!" w=16
+@rule core.ask_favor.t_kind_no guard: trait=kind act: no
+  "I'm so sorry, I can't manage that. I wish I could." w=16
+  "I wish I could, but I can't. Please ask me again soon." w=16
+@rule core.ask_opinion.t_kind_pos guard: trait=kind&!stance=con act: opine_pos
+  "{x:cap}? Oh, I do like that. Thank you for asking me." w=10
+@rule core.ask_opinion.t_kind_neg guard: trait=kind&!stance=pro act: opine_neg
+  "{x:cap}? Hm, not really for me. But I'm glad others like it." w=10
+
+# ---- lazy ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+@rule core.greet.t_lazy guard: trait=lazy&!cast act: greet
+  "Oh. Hi, {you}. I'd stand up, but I've just got comfy." w=14
+  "Hello, {you}. Sorry, I'm resting. It's a full-time job." w=14
+@rule core.invite.t_lazy_no guard: trait=lazy act: no
+  "Nah. I'd have to get dressed, and that's too much. Pass." w=16
+  "No, sorry. That sounds like effort. Maybe tomorrow?" w=16
+  "Maybe tomorrow. Or never. Not today." w=16
+@rule core.ask_favor.t_lazy_no guard: trait=lazy act: no
+  "Ugh, can't. Not today. Maybe tomorrow, or the day after." w=16
+  "Nope, too much effort. Maybe ask a friend?" w=16
+@rule core.ask_opinion.t_lazy_pos guard: trait=lazy&!stance=con act: opine_pos
+  "{x:cap}? Great, zero effort. Sign me up." w=10
+@rule core.ask_opinion.t_lazy_neg guard: trait=lazy&!stance=pro act: opine_neg
+  "{x:cap}? Too much work. Hard pass." w=10
+
+# ---- ambitious ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+@rule core.greet.t_ambitious guard: trait=ambitious&!cast act: greet
+  "Hello, {you}! Quick one, I've got goals in ten minutes." w=14
+  "Hi, {you}! Great timing. I'm between two big things." w=14
+@rule core.invite.t_ambitious_no guard: trait=ambitious act: no
+  "Can't, I've got a plan, and it's got a schedule." w=16
+  "No, sorry. I'm on a roll and I can't stop now." w=16
+  "I can't, I've got a pitch to rehearse. Ask me after the deal?" w=16
+@rule core.ask_favor.t_ambitious_no guard: trait=ambitious act: no
+  "Not now. I'm building something. It might involve you later." w=16
+  "I can't, but I could fit you in next quarter." w=16
+@rule core.ask_opinion.t_ambitious_pos guard: trait=ambitious&!stance=con act: opine_pos
+  "{x:cap}? Yes! That's got serious potential." w=10
+@rule core.ask_opinion.t_ambitious_neg guard: trait=ambitious&!stance=pro act: opine_neg
+  "{x:cap}? Dead end. There's no growth in it." w=10
+
+# ---- paranoid ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+@rule core.greet.t_paranoid guard: trait=paranoid&!cast act: greet
+  "Oh, it's you, {you}. Did anyone follow you?" w=14
+  "Hello, {you}. Come in, quick, and close the door behind you." w=14
+@rule core.invite.t_paranoid_no guard: trait=paranoid act: no
+  "No. It sounds like a trap. Sorry, but it's always a trap." w=16
+  "I can't. I've got a bad feeling. Pass." w=16
+  "I can't. Too many unknowns, and I don't like unknowns. Who's going?" w=16
+@rule core.ask_favor.t_paranoid_no guard: trait=paranoid act: no
+  "No. Who else knows about this? That's a no." w=16
+  "I can't. It's too risky, but ask someone else." w=16
+@rule core.ask_opinion.t_paranoid_pos guard: trait=paranoid&!stance=con act: opine_pos
+  "{x:cap}? It's all right. I've checked twice." w=10
+@rule core.ask_opinion.t_paranoid_neg guard: trait=paranoid&!stance=pro act: opine_neg
+  "{x:cap}? Suspicious. I've got my eye on it." w=10
+
+# ---- self_assured ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+@rule core.greet.t_self_assured guard: trait=self_assured&!cast act: greet
+  "Hello, {you}. Good call stopping by. I'm excellent today." w=14
+  "Hi, {you}! You're lucky, I'm at my best. Ask me anything." w=14
+@rule core.invite.t_self_assured_no guard: trait=self_assured act: no
+  "No, thanks. I know what I want, but it isn't that." w=16
+  "I'll pass. I'm sure of it, and I'm right. Ask me again if you like." w=16
+  "I'll pass, but you can thank me later for being honest." w=16
+@rule core.ask_favor.t_self_assured_no guard: trait=self_assured act: no
+  "No. I've decided. Ask someone else, it's a good decision." w=16
+  "I can't, but I'm sure you'll manage without me." w=16
+@rule core.ask_opinion.t_self_assured_pos guard: trait=self_assured&!stance=con act: opine_pos
+  "{x:cap}? Obviously. I called it ages ago." w=10
+@rule core.ask_opinion.t_self_assured_neg guard: trait=self_assured&!stance=pro act: opine_neg
+  "{x:cap}? No. I'm sure, I'm always sure." w=10
+
+# ---- shy ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+@rule core.greet.t_shy guard: trait=shy&!cast act: greet
+  "Oh! H-hello, {you}. Um, hi." w=14
+  "Hi, {you}. I was just, um, standing here. Hello." w=14
+@rule core.invite.t_shy_no guard: trait=shy act: no
+  "Um, sorry. I think I can't. Sorry again." w=16
+  "I would rather not, sorry. It sounds like a lot of people." w=16
+  "Um, maybe another time? Sorry, it's a bit much for me." w=16
+@rule core.ask_favor.t_shy_no guard: trait=shy act: no
+  "Um, I'm sorry, I can't. I'd mess it up. Sorry." w=16
+  "Sorry, I can't. But maybe someone braver can?" w=16
+@rule core.ask_opinion.t_shy_pos guard: trait=shy&!stance=con act: opine_pos
+  "Um, {x}? I like it, quietly. Please don't tell anyone." w=10
+@rule core.ask_opinion.t_shy_neg guard: trait=shy&!stance=pro act: opine_neg
+  "{x:cap}? Um, not really. Sorry." w=10
+
+# ---- outgoing ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+@rule core.greet.t_outgoing guard: trait=outgoing&!cast act: greet
+  "{you}! Hello! Come in, come in, meet everyone!" w=14
+  "Hey, {you}! Great to see you! Who else is coming?" w=14
+@rule core.invite.t_outgoing_no guard: trait=outgoing act: no
+  "Aw, I can't! But I'll be there in spirit! Loudly!" w=16
+  "No, sorry! I'm already at three things, but call me after!" w=16
+  "I can't, but ask me again! I'll bring ten friends!" w=16
+@rule core.ask_favor.t_outgoing_no guard: trait=outgoing act: no
+  "Can't, sorry! But I know someone who can. I know everyone!" w=16
+  "Can't! But ask around, everyone loves a favour!" w=16
+@rule core.ask_opinion.t_outgoing_pos guard: trait=outgoing&!stance=con act: opine_pos
