+  "Not now, I'm in the middle of a masterpiece. Ask me later?" w=16
+@rule core.ask_favor.t_creative_no guard: trait=creative act: no
+  "Sorry, I can't. I've got three half-finished things yelling at me." w=16
+  "I can't, but I could draw you a picture instead." w=16
+@rule core.ask_opinion.t_creative_pos guard: trait=creative&!stance=con act: opine_pos
