+  "I'd help, but only if there's cake. Is there cake?" w=16
+@rule core.ask_opinion.t_glutton_pos guard: trait=glutton&!stance=con act: opine_pos
+  "{x:cap}? Yes! Is there a snack involved, say yes." w=10
+@rule core.ask_opinion.t_glutton_neg guard: trait=glutton&!stance=pro act: opine_neg
+  "{x:cap}? Not edible, not interested." w=10
+
+# ---- morbid ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+@rule core.greet.t_morbid guard: trait=morbid&!kid_present&!cast act: greet
+  "Hello, {you}! The sky is so grey today. Gorgeous." w=14
+  "Hi, {you}. I found a lovely old tombstone. Free, if you want it." w=14
+@rule core.invite.t_morbid_no guard: trait=morbid&!kid_present act: no
+  "No, thanks. I'm busy being delightfully gloomy." w=16
+  "I'll pass, but thanks. A very dusty crypt is waiting." w=16
+  "No, but ask me again at midnight. I'm livelier then." w=16
+@rule core.ask_favor.t_morbid_no guard: trait=morbid&!kid_present act: no
+  "No. I've got a cobweb to admire, but maybe later." w=16
+  "I can't, but I can bring a very spooky candle instead." w=16
+@rule core.ask_opinion.t_morbid_pos guard: trait=morbid&!kid_present&!stance=con act: opine_pos
