+
+# ---- curious ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+@rule core.greet.t_curious guard: trait=curious&!cast act: greet
+  "Oh, hello, {you}! What's that, and where did you get it?" w=14
+  "Hi, {you}! I've got so many questions. First: hi." w=14
+@rule core.invite.t_curious_no guard: trait=curious act: no
+  "I can't, but who's going? Tell me all about it later!" w=16
+  "No, sorry! But I want to hear everything after. Everything." w=16
