+# ---- what they bring up on their own (talk_trait_bring_up: a topic of a liked or a disliked root) ----------
+# An idle remark about a topic the speaker leans to or away from, to the room or to one person. The stance guard
+# keeps the remark on the speaker's side of the topic. No romance topic is ever picked, and nobody is the target.
+@rule idle.liked guard: topic&stance=pro act: tell
+  "I've been thinking about {x} all day. Don't mind me." w=6
+  "Funny, I just realised how much I like {x}." w=6
+  "You know what's underrated? {x:cap}. Just saying." w=6
+  "Somebody say {x} out loud. I just want to hear it." w=6
+@rule idle.disliked guard: topic&stance=con act: tell
